    <briefdescription>
<para>A builder for a path in a CUDA graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class allows for the creation of a path in a CUDA graph, which is a sequence of nodes that are executed in order. The path builder can be used to add nodes to the path, and to set the dependencies between nodes. Thanks to the sequential nature of the path builder, it is possible to write single code path that uses either a stream or a path builder to result in either eager stream execution or construction of a lazy graph.</para>
